[node name="RichTextLabel" type="RichTextLabel" parent="TutorialContainer/MarginContainer/VBoxContainer" unique_id=1754226024]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_vertical = 3
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 3
theme_override_font_sizes/bold_font_size = 3
theme_override_font_sizes/bold_italics_font_size = 3
theme_override_font_sizes/italics_font_size = 3
theme_override_font_sizes/mono_font_size = 3
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "HELLO AND WELCOME TO YOUR FIRST DAY!

WE ACCIDENTALLY SET OFF A BUNCH OF BOMBS, SO NOW YOU HAVE A GREAT FIRST TASK.

DON'T WORRY, THEY ALL COME WITH [color=b45252]DETAILED INSTRUCTIONS[/color]. 

UNFORTUNATELY, AN INTERN MESSED THEM UP, SO THEY ALL HAVE EXACTLY [color=b45252]ONE INVALID RULE[/color]. AFTER YOU ELIMINATE THIS RULE, THERE SHOULD ONLY BE [color=b45252]ONE SOLUTION[/color]--IF THERE'S MORE THAN ONE, YOU PROBABLY ELIMINATED THE WRONG RULE.

[color=b45252]CLICK[/color] OR USE THE [color=b45252]NUMBER KEYS[/color] TO CUT THE WIRES, [color=b45252]CLICK THE ARROWS[/color] ON THE LEFT OR USE THE [color=b45252]ARROW KEYS[/color] TO LOOK THROUGH ALL THE RULES, AND USE [color=b45252]TAB[/color] TO FOCUS OR UNFOCUS THE NOTES.

YOU CAN TYPE IN THE NOTES OR DRAG AROUND THE NUMBERS TO THE RIGHT TO ORGANIZE YOUR THOUGHTS.

GOOD LUCK!"

